hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1049","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laaey jabke log phalon mein saal aur do saal key liye salaf (pehley qeemat dey kar) kartey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo khajoor mein salaf karey to use naapi hui paimaaish aur tauli hui taul mein salaf karna chaahiye. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Maaloom muddat tak. (Bukhari: 2239-2241)"
"1050","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar key zamaaney mein gehuun aur jau aur munakka aur khajoor mein salaf kartey they. (Bukhari: 2242)"
"1051","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Shaam key Nabtiyon se gehuun aur jau aur tel mein salaf kartey they, naapi hui paimaaish mein maaloom muddat tak. To un se kaha gaya: Uskey paas asl kiska tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham un se uskey baarey mein na poochhtey they. (Bukhari: 2244). Shufa ki kitaab."
